   "priceMinor": 175000,
   "currency": "EUR",
   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "The new Meridian continues the tradition of the field watch within the SPHAERA collection. The tradition of a robust and practical instrument. The dial offers perfect readability and a timeless, straightforward design. The time is immediately recognizable at first glance. The case and the delicate finish of the brushed and polished stainless steel edges bring their own elegant suppleness. The appealing small seconds and the discreet indices help here. The watch's sophistication comes to the fore at second glance. The Meridian is the stereotype of a watch that is brushed for pure functionality and yet stylishly elegant. The perfect companion for any occasion, whether worn with an army jacket or a blazer.",
