   "priceMinor": 240833,
   "currency": "EUR",
   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "Introducing the Blue Moon — a timepiece as unique as the celestial event it honors. Available exclusively for pre-order during the Blue Moon phase (until Wednesday, August 21), this watch is limited to just 10 pieces during this release. The dial is a masterpiece in itself, featuring a stunning sunburst effect created by spinning the dial at low speed while applying a linear brush at high speed. The result is a mesmerizing gradient that transitions from deep dark blue to a soft light blue, capturing the essence of a Blue Moon. This watch not only celebrates the first super moon of the year on August 19 but also makes a striking accessory for any cocktail hour. And here's something extra special—it's Sphaera's very first blue dial, launched on a Blue Monday, under a Blue Moon. Equipped with a high grade in house modified La Joux-Perret Automatic Movement with 70 hours of Power Reserve. Once the Blue Moon fades, so does this opportunity. Next Blue Moon : 31 May 2026",
