   "priceMinor": 405900,
   "currency": "EUR",
   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "The Blue Damast is the wonderful result of a collaboration with the Salzburger Messerschmiede Duo A. Anglberger & A. Fellner. Each dial has a unique pattern making each watch individual, meaning no two dials are alike. The dial is made out of Damascus Steel, hand-forged out of high quality Austrian tool steel. Hand polishing, etching and tempered coloring gives them their final dark blue/ grey color. The result of long hours of forging and hammering produces around 8 dials, where 3 go to waste during the grinding of the top layer of the dial to just 0.3 mm. Leaving us with a limited run of only 5 pieces. Equipped with a high grade in house modified La Joux-Perret Automatic Movement with 70 hours of Power Reserve. Contact Us for Inquiries",
